		"description": {
			"baseEffect": "<p><strong>Tier 2 · 2 Actions · Reach 6.</strong></p><p>Nothing happens this turn. On your next turn, the target takes 4d6+5 damage. This can't miss. Ignores armor. The damage type reflects the foreseen event (a stray arrow would deal Piercing damage, the flaming chicken flying into them could be Fire damage, etc).</p>",
